    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "You already know",
     "texto": [
      "**Ведь** asks the other person to remember or confirm: **Ты ведь знаешь Анну!** («But you know Anna!»). It goes after the word that is emphasised: **Ты ведь придёшь?** («You will come, won't you?»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Questions with surprise",
     "texto": [
      "**Разве** («really...?») and **неужели** («really...?») express doubt or surprise: **Разве ты не знаешь?** («Don't you actually know?»), **Неужели он уехал?** («Has he really left?»).",
      "**Же** adds emphasis: **Это же ты!** («But it's you!»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
